$ grep -n "onSnapshot" Wedding-Ease-Viva-Chat/src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx
(no matches)

# This is the exact state that WE-20260527-170 (resolution comment) said
# would be fixed by adding `onSnapshot(doc(db,'users',uid))` so the
# AuthContext.profile is realtime. The fix branch (fix-WE-20260527-170, commit
# bb3d797) exists but has not been merged to main / Bug-Resolve-claude.

# Regression trigger pattern (no live test needed — code is identical to pre-fix):
#   - Tier upgrade webhook flips users/{uid}.tierMirror from 'free' to 'pro'.
#   - useAccount() refetches and shows the new tier.
#   - AuthContext.profile.tierMirror is still stale 'free' because getDoc only
#     ran on initial sign-in.
#   - useChat at hooks/useChat.ts:507 reads profile.toneSettings via AuthContext;
#     stale tier flows into the chat request body alongside it.
#   - Consumers like ChatSidebar (line 502) and Index.tsx (1349-1350) read
#     useAuth().profile → stale UI for "you are on the Free plan" until the
#     user does a hard refresh.

# REGRESSION VERDICT: WE-20260527-170 fix is NOT in main. The branch needs
# merge + dev backend restart before this is closed.
